 the name of esken or sacred treasure is  the divine axe Rita a massive and  insanely heavy battle axe in his daytime  form s Kannur gives off a great amount  of heat which can actually hurt the  people who are in his vicinity but his  sacred treasure allows him to gather all  of that excess energy inside the axe and  then release it when the time is right  scanners power level has been measured  at as low as 15 in his night time form  and as high as 114 thousand which is  just insane in his daytime mode because  his power level fluctuates so much  throughout the day it is virtually  impossible to measure the true extent of  Eskin or power and because of how  immense his power becomes a scanner  still struggles to control it and he is  sometimes known to lose control which he  then later regret like many characters  in the seven deadly sins a scanner has a  very interesting backstory that really  shaped him as a character he was born as  a prince of a Britannia kingdom called  Castelli Oh a scanner Oh had an older  brother who would often mistreat him but  then one day a scanners unique power  awoke inside of him and he broke his  older brother's arm by accident after  this incident and because of the  appearance of his mysterious power the  people of the castello kingdom began to  look at s Canora as some kind of freak  his own parents disowned him and after  the Kingdom soldiers tried to kill him  for being a dangerous monster he was  barely able to escape with his life by  hiding in a barrel and drifting off to  sea inside of it as his power continued  to develop s Kannur was feared and  looked at as a monster everywhere he  went and even when he tried to show  others that he was a good person they  still feared him and rejected him all of  this took a great toll on s Kannur and  he felt ostracized by everyone the one  person who did not see s Kannur as a  dangerous monster was Merlin and when he  met her s Kannur instantly fell in love  with Merlin the one person who was not  afraid of him but actually interested in  his unique power in what is a huge twist  of irony the proud and supremely  confident s Kannur is often shy in front  of Merlin because of his feelings for  her you could even say that he is  insecure about Merlin because he doesn't  know if she will ever feel the same way  about him as he does about her and in  the manga he was even shown to be  jealous of Merlin's relationship with  Arthur Pendragon s karna enjoys writing  poetry including special poems for  Merlin but he is insecure about those as  well and he has been shown to worry  about whether his poems are worthy of  Merlin  actually hearing them askin or special  power is called sunshine we later  learned that sunshine was a blessing or  grace created by the supreme deity the  ruler of the goddess clan and him  bestowed upon mile one of the four  Archangels in fact Miele was believed to  be the strongest out of the four  Archangels but he was allegedly killed  by Esther OSA three thousand years ago  after miles death sunshine somehow  passed on to Eskin orb but at this time  we don't actually know how or why that  happened what makes Eska nor so  interesting is the stark duality of his  personality the huge contrast between  the two sides of his character on the  one hand he is an incredibly powerful  pinnacle of manliness and he is so proud  and confident that you can't help but  laugh at how he looks down on his  opponents in that sense s Canora kind of  reminds me of coming up from Gurren  Lagann and if you know me then you know  that kameena is my favorite anime  character of all time so in that sense I  definitely have a special place in my  heart for s Kannur but on the other hand  despite his incredible power s Canora  had an extremely traumatic childhood  imagine being ostracized and cast out by  everyone you know because of something  that you have no control over  imagine being disowned by your own  parents and almost killed as a child  just because a strange power manifested  inside you through no fault of your own  that is exactly the type of backstory  that would make someone the opposite of  confident something like that would make  a person feel insecure and it would  leave them with major abandonment issues  and we can see this conflict raging  within esken or whether it is nighttime  or daytime s canora's feelings for  merlin betray his inner insecurities  even as he mocks his enemies for daring  to be born into the same world as him s  Kannur is clearly in love with merlin he  has great respect for her and he does  not consider himself to be superior to  her even at the height of his power  because merlin is one of the very few  people who treated s Kannur with  kindness when everyone else saw him as a  monster s Kannur is very cautious not to  screw up his relationship with merlin  because he doesn't want to lose her and  that is why he is known to act with  shyness and insecurities  her even though he is the sin of pride  esken or doesn't have the confidence to  admit his true feelings to merlin  probably because he is afraid that she  will never feel the same way about him  and he doesn't want merlin to push him  away after she learns about his true  feelings so he is torn between opening  up to merlin and keeping his feelings  hidden and this is the funny thing about  Eskin or even though during the daytime  he is such an over-the-top  larger-than-life supremely confident and  tremendously powerful warrior he is  still only human and we can all relate  to his fears and insecurities as Kannur  considers his unique power to be a curse  a curse which isolated him from his  fellow humans made him a freak and a  monster in the eyes of everyone he knew  even his own parents even though he uses  this curse to great effect in battle  ESCA noir is still haunted by his  difficult past and he is very careful  around people like Merlin because he  doesn't want the few people who actually  don't consider him a monster to turn  their back on him on the one hand s  Connor is the powerful and totally  badass Lyon sin of pride but on the  other he is just a human being wants to  be accepted and loved by others which is  something that he never even experienced  until he met Merlin and the other sins s  Kannur is clearly not a one-dimensional  character he is a nuanced and  multi-dimensional character like so many  other characters in the seven deadly  sins which is one of the biggest reasons  why I love this series as the manga goes  on I have a feeling that we are going to  see s Kannur and Merlin's relationship  develops so I am looking forward to that  let me know what you guys think down in  the comments do you like s Kannur as a  character and do you think that he will  eventually succeed in winning over  Merlin's heart also how many praise the  Sun comments are we going to get on this  video let's find out if you enjoy this  type of content be sure to leave a like  to let me know if you're new to this  channel don't forget to subscribe and  hit that notification bell so you can be  notified every time a new video is out  don't forget to follow us on Twitter and  Instagram at anime uproar for daily  anime content as always thank you all so  much for watching I really appreciate it  and until next time see us space cowboys  you  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

